prototype. Cargo.toml is adapted for the Oxide-scoped path build; storage.rs
shares bounded whole-storage CRC verification across tensor aliases belonging
to the same retained archive owner, with real ZIP alias/corruption tests. Deflated
ZIP verification remains unsupported in the prototype API; Oxide rejects
compressed entries for bounded backend publication. See provenance.json for the
